  "claimBoundary": "The end-to-end study estimates the effect of an installed UGP runtime sidecar under a fixed minimal actor loop. UGP Capsules must originate in live application Bindings backed by frozen authoritative code, domain models, official API/schema, or product documentation. Static screenshot representation studies are auxiliary and are not evidence of native UGP deployment.",
